## Why This Is Asked
Tests DP with dual objectives: minimize cost and count optimal deletion sets, plus implement in two styles. It also covers edge cases like empty substrings and ties.

## Key Concepts
- DP on substrings; store (cost, ways).
- Memoization and bottom-up parallels; careful counting on ties.
- Modulo arithmetic for counts.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Memoized DFS
function solveMemo(s, delCost){
  const n = s.length;
  const memoCost = Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n).fill(-1));
  const memoWays = Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n).fill(0));
  const MOD = 1_000_000_007;
  function dfs(l,r){
    if (l>=r) return {cost:0, ways:1};
    if (memoCost[l][r]!==-1) return {cost:memoCost[l][r], ways:memoWays[l][r]};
    if (s[l]===s[r]){
      const res = dfs(l+1,r-1);
      memoCost[l][r]=res.cost;
      memoWays[l][r]=res.ways;
      return res;
    } else {
      const A = dfs(l+1,r);
      const B = dfs(l,r-1);
      let cost;
      let ways = 0;
      if (A.cost + delCost[l] < B.cost + delCost[r]){
        cost = A.cost + delCost[l];
        ways = A.ways;
      } else if (B.cost + delCost[r] < A.cost + delCost[l]){
        cost = B.cost + delCost[r];
        ways = B.ways;
      } else {
        cost = A.cost + Math.min(delCost[l], delCost[r]);
        ways = (A.ways + B.ways) % MOD;
      }
      memoCost[l][r]=cost; memoWays[l][r]=ways;
      return {cost, ways};
    }
  }
  return dfs(0,n-1);
}
```

## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical graph DP with a real-world flavor (service startup), ensuring knowledge of cycle detection, topological order, and dynamic programming.

## Key Concepts

- Topological sort (Kahn/DFS)
- DAG DP for path/finish times
- Cycle detection via processed node count

## Code Example

```javascript
function earliestStartup(graph, startup, t) {
  const V = graph.length;
  const indeg = new Array(V).fill(0);
  for (let u = 0; u < V; u++) for (const v of graph[u]) indeg[v]++;
  const q = [];
  const earliest = startup.slice();
  for (let i = 0; i < V; i++) if (indeg[i] === 0) q.push(i);
  let seen = 0;
  while (q.length) {
    const u = q.shift();
    seen++;
    for (const v of graph[u]) {
      earliest[v] = Math.max(earliest[v], earliest[u] + startup[v]);
      if (--indeg[v] === 0) q.push(v);
    }
  }
  if (seen !== V) throw new Error('cycle detected');
  return earliest[t];
}
```

